        "text_J8c8tJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Why Freeze Dried Salmon Dog Treats Are Essential for Your Pup</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Urc8Hy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As pet owners, we strive to provide our dogs with treats that are not only tasty but also beneficial for their health. Among the many options available, freeze dried salmon dog treats stand out for their incredible nutritional value and irresistible flavor. These nutrient-packed snacks support your dog’s overall well-being while satisfying their cravings. In this guide, we’ll dive into the benefits of freeze dried salmon dog treats, how to choose the best ones, and why these treats should be part of your dog's diet</p>"
