    "rich_text_xbFPbM": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_ynjcCq": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>What Are Freeze Dried Salmon Dog Treats?</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_faVBT6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Freeze drying is an excellent option for preserving the nutrients, flavor, and aroma of food. Freeze dried salmon dog treats are made from wild-caught salmon, preserving its high-quality protein, omega-3 fatty acids, and essential vitamins. Unlike many other treats, they are free from preservatives, fillers, and artificial additives, making them an ideal choice for dogs with food sensitivities or allergies.</p><p><br/>Salmon is packed with omega-3 fatty acids, which support a healthy coat, joint mobility, and heart health. By adding freeze dried salmon dog treats to your dog’s diet, you’re providing them with a treat that’s both delicious and full of health benefits.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_ynjcCq",
        "text_faVBT6"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.rich-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "content_alignment": "center",
