    "rich_text_KaQxnw": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_rXpewP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Health Benefits of Freeze Dried Salmon Dog Treats</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_zht9aM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Supports Healthy Coat and Skin</strong><br/>Omega-3 fatty acids are essential for maintaining a healthy, shiny coat. If your dog has dry skin, shedding, or a dull coat, incorporating freeze dried salmon dog treats can make a noticeable difference. The natural oils in salmon help nourish the skin and reduce inflammation, leaving your dog’s coat soft and glossy.<br/><br/><strong>Enhances Joint Health and Mobility</strong><br/>Omega-3s are known for their anti-inflammatory properties, which can significantly improve joint health and mobility. This is particularly beneficial for older dogs or those with arthritis. Many pet owners have noticed improved mobility in their dogs after introducing salmon-based treats to their diet.<br/><br/><strong>Promotes Heart Health</strong><br/>Rich in vitamins like B12, D, and A, salmon is great for cardiovascular health. Omega-3 fatty acids, in particular, are beneficial for heart function, helping to reduce the risk of heart disease. By including freeze-dried salmon dog treats in your dog's routine, you're supporting their heart health in a natural way.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
