    "rich_text_AUanFq": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_UYQpe3": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Freeze Dried vs. Other Salmon Treats: What’s the Difference?</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_AQxGdm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When shopping for dog treats, you may come across various types, such as cooked or dehydrated salmon treats. While these options are good, freeze dried salmon stands out because it preserves more of the natural nutrients than cooking or dehydrating. Freeze dried treats also have a longer shelf life, making them more convenient and easy to store.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
