    "rich_text_7GJRRB": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Q6cWLY": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>How to Choose the Best Freeze Dried Salmon Dog Treats</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_faMV36": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Not all freeze dried salmon dog treats are created equal. Here are some tips to help you select the best option for your dog:<br/></p><p><strong>Look for Single Ingredient Treats</strong><br/>The best freeze dried salmon dog treats should contain only one ingredient: salmon. This ensures that your dog is receiving pure, natural nutrition without unnecessary fillers or artificial additives.<br/><br/><strong>Check for Wild-Caught Salmon</strong><br/>Always opt for treats that use wild-caught salmon rather than farmed salmon. Wild-caught salmon is richer in nutrients and free from harmful chemicals and antibiotics that can sometimes be found in farmed fish. Additionally, wild-caught salmon is more sustainable, which is better for the environment.<br/><br/><strong>Check for Quality Certifications</strong><br/>Choose treats that are produced in FDA-regulated facilities to ensure they meet safety standards and are manufactured in a controlled, clean environment.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Q6cWLY",
        "text_faMV36"
      ],
