      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_PXi69P": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Freeze Dried Salmon Dog Treats: The Perfect Training Reward</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_pF4tcg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Freeze dried salmon dog treats are perfect for training sessions. Their high protein content makes them an excellent motivator, and their irresistible aroma helps keep your dog focused. Whether you’re teaching basic commands or working on more advanced tricks, these treats are sure to keep your dog engaged and eager to learn.</p>"
          }
        }
