      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Q7drgC": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Conclusion: Give Your Dog the Best with Freeze Dried Salmon Dog Treats</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_Ff8GJk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When it comes to spoiling your dog with a healthy, tasty treat, freeze dried salmon dog treats should be at the top of your list. These treats are packed with omega-3 fatty acids, high-quality protein, and essential vitamins that promote a shiny coat, strong joints, and a healthy heart. Whether used as a training reward, a food topper, or a special snack, your dog will love the taste and the health benefits.<br/>Start adding freeze dried salmon dog treats to your dog’s diet today — because they deserve the best!<br/><br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
