    "rich_text_wVWxnC": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_xVMrXT": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>FAQs </strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_G6zn6q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>1.Can I give my dog freeze dried salmon treats every day?</strong><br/>Yes, but they should make up no more than 10% of your dog’s daily caloric intake.<br/><br/><strong>2.Are freeze dried salmon treats suitable for puppies?</strong><br/>Yes, they can be given to puppies, but always check the size of the treats and feed them in moderation.<br/><br/><strong>3.Do freeze dried salmon treats work for dogs with food allergies?</strong><br/>Yes, freeze dried salmon dog treats are often free from common allergens like grains, gluten, and artificial additives, making them a great option for dogs with food sensitivities.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
